.tvb.com/tc/1187913-%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E5%B1%80%E5%8B%A2%E7%A9%86%E5%82%91%E5%A1%94%E5%B7%B4%E6%97%A5%E5%89%8D%E5%82%B3%E5%87%BA%E7%97%85%E5%8D%B1%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8A%E7%A4%BE%E7%99%BC%E6%94%BE%E5%85%B6%E7%89%87%E6%AE%B5%E6%9C%AA%E8%A6%8B%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%E6%9C%AA%E8%81%9E%E5%85%B6%E8%81%B2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢穆傑塔巴駁斥病危傳言</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1188447-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%93%9A%E5%A0%B1%E5%8C%97%E7%B4%84%E5%B3%B0%E6%9C%83%E5%BE%8C%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8A%E8%88%8A%E7%89%88%E7%A9%BA%E8%BB%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%99%9F%E9%9B%A2%E9%96%8B%E7%82%BA%E7%85%99%E5%B9%95%E5%9C%96%E8%BA%B2%E9%81%BF%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E6%9A%97%E6%AE%BA%E5%A8%81%E8%84%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢特朗普據報為躲避伊朗暗殺換專機</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1188006-%E9%9C%8D%E7%88%BE%E6%9C%A8%E8%8C%B2%E8%88%B9%E9%81%8B%E9%87%8F%E6%9A%B4%E8%B7%8C96%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E9%A1%AF%E6%95%88%E6%83%9F%E9%9D%A2%E8%87%A8%E9%9B%99%E5%88%83%E5%8A%8D%E4%BB%A3%E5%83%B9%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢霍爾木茲船運量暴跌96%　伊朗「經濟武器」策略顯效惟面臨雙刃劍代價｜國際分析</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">【哥倫比亞<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">7.4級地震</span>】</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">8月10日，哥倫比亞西部發生<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">7.4級地震，累計至少265人罹難，逾3,700人受傷。當局宣布全國哀悼三天。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1188453-%E5%93%A5%E5%80%AB%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9E%E8%A5%BF%E9%83%A8%E5%BC%B7%E9%9C%87%E5%A2%9E%E8%87%B3224%E6%AD%BB%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E7%9B%B8%E4%BF%A1%E8%88%87%E5%A7%94%E5%85%A7%E7%91%9E%E6%8B%89%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87%E7%84%A1%E9%97%9C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢專家：相信與委內瑞拉地震無關</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1188646-%E5%93%A5%E5%80%AB%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9E%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87%E6%9C%89%E8%A2%AB%E5%9B%B0%E7%93%A6%E7%A4%AB%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E7%8D%B2%E6%95%91%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%8B%E4%BC%B8%E5%87%BA%E6%8F%B4%E6%89%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢多名被困瓦礫民眾獲救</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">【日本<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">關東</span>暴雨】</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">日本關東地區下暴雨，8人死亡，</span>千葉縣嚴重水浸，期間往返東京市區的鐵路和巴士停駛。成田機場一度有幾千人滯留，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">不少香港旅客受影響。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1189188-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E9%97%9C%E6%9D%B1%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A88%E6%AD%BB%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E6%8C%87%E9%9B%A8%E9%9B%B2%E6%88%96%E6%B5%81%E5%90%91%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%E5%BF%83%E5%8F%8A%E5%9F%BC%E7%8E%89%E7%B8%A3%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BC%B7%E9%99%8D%E9%9B%A8%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢多地受災嚴重交通癱瘓</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1189182-%E6%9C%89%E5%8D%83%E8%91%89%E7%B8%A3%E8%BF%94%E6%B8%AF%E6%B8%AF%E4%BA%BA%E7%A8%B1%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8%E6%9C%9F%E9%96%93%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%8F%97%E9%98%BB%E5%8F%88%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%BA%E9%8C%AF%E9%81%8E%E8%88%AA%E7%8F%AD%E7%95%99%E5%9C%A8%E6%A9%9F%E5%A0%B4%E7%9E%93%E7%9D%A1%E8%A2%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢不少返港港人稱暴雨期間行程受阻</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">【美國對無人機徵最高百分百關稅】</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國將對進口無人機及零部件加徵百分之十至百分之百關稅。此外，白宮發表報告，指控中國透過四十多個經濟體轉運出口商品，規避美國關稅。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1189064-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%B0%8D%E9%80%B2%E5%8F%A3%E7%84%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%A9%9F%E5%8F%8A%E9%9B%B6%E9%83%A8%E4%BB%B6%E5%BE%B5%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E7%99%BE%E5%88%86%E7%99%BE%E9%97%9C%E7%A8%85%E6%8C%87%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E8%97%89%E8%BD%89%E9%81%8B%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E8%A6%8F%E9%81%BF%E7%B9%B3%E7%A8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➢點擊重溫</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T16:39:05.272546+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1534,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}